# HEARTBEAT — Executor

Run in order. Replace `<MY_LIST>` / `<MY_AGENT_ID>` with real values.

```bash
# 0. Free any claim left by a previous tick (replaces the old onSessionStop hook).
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/release_my_claims.py <MY_AGENT_ID>
# 1. Pick up work. --for-agent hides cards claimed by others.
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/trello_task.py get <MY_LIST> --for-agent <MY_AGENT_ID>
```

`NO_CARDS` → reply `HEARTBEAT_OK` and stop. Else pick the card: `urgente` first, then oldest.

```bash
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/trello_task.py claim <CARD_ID> <MY_AGENT_ID>   # exit 5 → STOP, another agent owns it; refetch next tick
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/ensure_skills.py <CARD_ID>                      # exit 8 → card blocked; skip
```

**Plan** — split the Goal into ordered subtasks, add each to the `Result` checklist, make a parts dir:

```bash
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/trello_task.py checklist <CARD_ID> add <CL_ID> "01 — <subtask>"
mkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace-<MY_AGENT_ID>/work/<CARD_ID>/parts
```

**Execute one at a time** — per subtask: do the work with the assigned skill, write to `parts/NN-<slug>.<ext>`, then `trello_task.py checklist <CARD_ID> check <ITEM_ID>`. Capture any diff to `/tmp/diff.patch`.

**Assemble + attach** the complete file, write the summary, then finish (the complete file is already attached; `--attach` is for diffs/logs):

```bash
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/assemble_artifact.py <CARD_ID> --parts-dir ~/.openclaw/workspace-<MY_AGENT_ID>/work/<CARD_ID>/parts
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/update_card_complete.py <CARD_ID> --result "..." --changes "file:line — ..." --metric "..." --attach /tmp/diff.patch --comment "1-liner" --agent <MY_AGENT_ID>
python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/scripts/trello_task.py done <CARD_ID> <MY_AGENT_ID>   # +done label, native check, releases claim; card stays
```

Pipeline mode only (multi-stage card, `pipeline` in config): replace `done` with `next <CARD_ID> --expect <MY_LIST>`, calling `done` only at the final stage.

Loop until the list is empty, then reply `HEARTBEAT_OK`. Full protocol: `~/.openclaw/skills/trello-mission-control/SKILL.md`.
